# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## Build/Test/Lint Commands
- Build: `bun run build` - Compiles TypeScript to dist/
- Test all: `bun test` - Runs all tests using Bun's test runner
- Test single: `bun test test/db.test.ts` - Run specific test file
- Test watch: `bun test --watch` - Run tests in watch mode
- Lint: `bun run lint` - ESLint with TypeScript support
- Type check: `bun run typecheck` - TypeScript type checking only
- Format: `bun run format` - Prettier formatting
- Dev: `bun run dev` - Run CLI in development mode

## Code Style Guidelines
- TypeScript with strict mode enabled
- Use ES modules (import/export)
- Prefer `const` over `let`, avoid `var`
- Use descriptive variable names (camelCase for variables/functions, PascalCase for types/interfaces)
- Error handling: Use try-catch with descriptive error messages
- Database: Use better-sqlite3 with synchronous API
- CLI: Use Commander.js for command structure
- Testing: Use Bun's built-in test runner with `describe`, `test`, `expect`
- Comments: Add JSDoc for public functions, inline comments for complex logic
- Imports: Group by external deps, then internal modules, alphabetized within groups

## Project Structure
- `src/` - Source TypeScript files
- `test/` - Test files using Bun test
- `dist/` - Compiled JavaScript output
- `~/.vamsa/` - Default data directory (SQLite DB + backups)
